.SS "void csmp::IsoparametricQuadraticTetrahedron_Test::CheckElementFaceConsistency (const \fBElement\fP< 3U > & e)"
Checks that the face normals are pointing correctly and computes face flux balance over all faces of the element\&. This should be zero\&.

